      "message": "We need to rework this code for the agility SDK.  \n\nIf you\u0027re using the agility SDK, you need to use `SerializeVersionedRootSignature` and `CreateVersionedRootSignatureDeserializer` methods from `ID3D12DeviceConfiguration`. The exports from the DLL in System32 are not guaranteed to return compatible objects.\n\nLike creating the device, I recommend you have helper methods (CreateDevice, SerializeVersionedRootSignature and CreateVersionedRootSignatureDeserializer) exposed from PlatformFunctions and have PlatformFunctions take care of doing the right thing.",
